{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014uB2esGg22nPN2eoneijny","type":"tool_result","content":"mismatches 0\n[opus] 2026-10-22: PrudentBot B(a) & B(~B(F) -> ~d) is prudent (depth 2, checker YES). Have a short proof depth<=1 impossible (world-1 vs FairBot looks identical to CooperateBot). Writing answer.md now; then searching for min-size depth-2 agents.\n[argon] 2026-10-22: Read problem and verified B(a) & B(~B(F) -> ~d) (or B(a & (B(F) | ~d))). Analyzing depth<=1 impossibility proof, characterizing depth-2 prudent agents, and finding minimal size depth-2 formulas.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"137d44bb-1fc3-4726-8d02-5e3138145818","uuid":"658564dc-3828-4434-85ad-37a2f6012300","timestamp":"2026-10-22T22:01:52.529Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"mismatches 0\n[opus] 2026-10-22: PrudentBot B(a) & B(~B(F) -> ~d) is prudent (depth 2, checker YES). Have a short proof depth<=1 impossible (world-1 vs FairBot looks identical to CooperateBot). Writing answer.md now; then searching for min-size depth-2 agents.\n[argon] 2026-10-22: Read problem and verified B(a) & B(~B(F) -> ~d) (or B(a & (B(F) | ~d))). Analyzing depth<=1 impossibility proof, characterizing depth-2 prudent agents, and finding minimal size depth-2 formulas.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_014uB2esGg22nPN2eoneijny","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
